%% Collaboration 03: Payee Validation
flowchart LR
  CustomerApp["Customer App"]
  PayeeAPI["Payee API"]
  Validation["Validation Service"]
  Directory["Bank Directory"]
  Risk["Risk Engine"]
  NotifySvc["Notification Service"]

  CustomerApp -->|create payee request| PayeeAPI
  PayeeAPI -->|lookup bank/account metadata| Directory
  Directory -->|directory details| PayeeAPI
